      "content": "That's a good start. Can you go deeper into that paradox you mentioned regarding centralized planning? If we're looking to frame this for a debate, how can we specifically point out that their proposed solutions are actually just more extreme versions of the problems they claim to hate? Give me the most effective way to phrase that contradiction so it sticks.",
